tY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.9259;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="member" target="breq"><mxGeometry x="0.3" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="430" y="34"/><mxPoint x="2840" y="34"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="a_submitss" value="1" style="edgeLabel;html=1;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="a_submits"><mxGeometry x="-0.985" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-14" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="a_submitst" value="0..*" style="edgeLabel;html=1;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="a_submits"><mxGeometry x="0.985" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="14" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n_role" value="&lt;b&gt;Roles (FR2, FR5)&lt;/b&gt;: a ClubMember holds exactly one ClubRole at a time. Roles are objects, not subclasses of the account, so changing position keeps the same identity. Only PresidentRole may call assignRole(); every permission check also runs on the server (NFR1, NFR12)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="1300" width="420" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n_event" value="&lt;b&gt;Event lifecycle (FR11–FR15)&lt;/b&gt;: PENDING → APPROVED / REJECTED / CHANGES_REQUESTED; CHANGES_REQUESTED → PENDING on resubmit; PENDING / APPROVED → CANCELLED before start (reason required). updateStatus() and cancel() compare expectedVersion with version and refuse stale actions (NFR15). getApprover(): building's room allocator (on campus) or club's faculty advisor (trip)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1760" y="940" width="240" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n_dec" value="&lt;b&gt;{immutable}&lt;/b&gt; decision records are never edited (NFR7). REJECTED and CHANGES_REQUESTED need comments (FR7, FR13, FR14). EventReview.decidedBy must be event.getApprover(); BudgetDecisionRecord.decidedBy must hold PresidentRole in the request's club." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2960" y="1010" width="250" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n_bud" value='&lt;b&gt;Budget rules&lt;/b&gt;: {event.status = APPROVED} for "requested for" (FR6). approve() calls ClubBudget.hasSufficientFunds() and then allocate() (P5, FR8). remainingBalance is derived (totalBudget − allocatedAmount); money uses Decimal to keep calculations exact (NFR6).' style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2960" y="250" width="260" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Green: Accounts, Roles &amp;amp; Notifications (Ahmed)&lt;br/&gt;Blue: Event Proposals (Haziq)&lt;br/&gt;Orange: Budget Requests (Abdelrahman)&lt;br/&gt;Purple: added or promoted during integration&lt;br/&gt;Grey: enumerations; dashed: «derived view» (not stored)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2340" y="1440" width="330" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l_role" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;fontStyle=2;labelBackgroundColor=none;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=2;endArrow=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b09500;exitX=0.6;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.6;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n_role" target="treas"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="l_event" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;edgeStyle=none;fontStyle=2;labelBackgroundColor=none;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=2;endArrow=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b09500;exitX=0;exitY=0.2;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=1.098;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n_event" target="event"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="l_dec" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;fontStyle=2;labelBackgroundColor=none;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=2;endArrow=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b09500;exitX=0;exitY=0.2;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.9;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n_dec" target="decision"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="l_bud" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;fontStyle=2;labelBackgroundColor=none;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingBottom=2;endArrow=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b09500;exitX=0.3;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n_bud" target="cbudget"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>